"Are you prepared?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleTowerBattleRoom/scripts.inc:501
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleTowerBattleRoom_Text_GreetingsImAnabel"
msgid ""
"Greetings…\n"
"My name is ANABEL.\p"
"I am the SALON MAIDEN, and I am in\n"
"charge of running the BATTLE TOWER…\p"
"I have heard several rumors\n"
"about you…\p"
"In all honesty, what I have heard does\n"
"not seem attractive in any way…\p"
"The reason I've come to see you…\n"
"Well, there is but one reason…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleTowerBattleRoom/scripts.inc:513
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleTowerBattleRoom_Text_LetMeSeeYourTalent"
msgid ""
"Let me see your talent in\n"
"its entirety…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleTowerBattleRoom/scripts.inc:517
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleTowerBattleRoom_Text_AnabelTalentShallBeRecognized"
msgid ""
"ANABEL: Fufufu, nicely done…\p"
"Your FRONTIER PASS, please…\n"
"Your talent shall be recognized.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleTowerBattleRoom/scripts.inc:522
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleTowerBattleRoom_Text_ReceivedAbilitySymbol"
msgid ""
"The Ability Symbol was embossed on\n"
"the FRONTIER PASS!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleTowerBattleRoom/scripts.inc:526
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleTowerBattleRoom_Text_UntilNextTime"
msgid ""
"… … … … … …\p"
"You have confidence in your POKéMON\n"
"battling talent, don't you?\p"
"I urge you to keep battling and\n"
"keep on winning.\p"
"I will be waiting for you.\n"
"Until the next time we meet…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleTowerBattleRoom/scripts.inc:535
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleTowerBattleRoom_Text_AnabelYouCameBack"
msgid ""
"ANABEL: You really did come back to\n"
"see me…\p"
"… … … … … …\p"
"You've won straight matches to see me…\n"
"I won't have to hold back against you…\p"
"It's been too long now…\p"
"Too long since I've been able to battle\n"
"without thinking about anything…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleTowerBattleRoom/scripts.inc:545
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleTowerBattleRoom_Text_LetsBeginShallWe"
msgid "Let's begin, shall we?$"
msgstr ""

